// Ṭaḍoro given names, kept by hand. Read by src/names/people.rs; the readable
// copy is docs/names.md (`cargo run --release --bin lang -- names`).
//
//   name     the name (small letters; the game adds the capital)
//   gender   Male, Female, or Either (a name anyone may carry)
//   made     its recipe from the roots in roots.ron: `stone`, `bright+stone`
//            (the first describes the second), `wave:small`, `hill:great`
//   end      the name ending put on it (grammar.ron)
//
// The meaning is read off the recipe. `name` must be what the rules make of
// `made` and `end`: a test checks, so after a change to a root or a sound
// rule the list is brought back in step rather than drifting.
// To drop a name, delete its line. No two names here are a letter apart.
